<title>UK: OZ Holding sets warrants on UBS shares.</title>
<headline>OZ Holding sets warrants on UBS shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>OZ Holding, Zurich said it has</p>
<p>issued two million European-style put warrants, on UBS bearer</p>
<p>shares.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1300 CHF		  ISSUE	  8.85 CHF</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	19.SEP.97		 PAYDATE	03.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT TEN</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1310 CHF</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
